<h3 id="toc4"><span>IN ACCORDANCE WITH SITE-01 DECLASSIFICATION PROTOCOLS, THIS OFFICIAL VERDICT WILL BE AVAILABLE TO <span style="font-size:75%;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Level 2</span></span> PERSONNEL ON <span style="font-size:75%;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">2223/01/14</span></span>.</span></h3>
