<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-4"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-4')">4</a>. As a result of his amnesticization, former Vice Director Werckman has no recollection of these events, and as such will not be available for interview for the purposes of this investigation.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-5"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-5')">5</a>. There are no records of such a conference having ever been held at Site 333, which is a three-person research station in [REDACTED] specializing in the containment of anomalous tropical fish.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-6"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-6')">6</a>. Former Site Director Wakefield did not issue a moratorium on SCP-5217 testing at any time before his removal from office.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-7"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-7')">7</a>. Subsequent memetistic analysis conducted at Site 41 on 2023/01/03 revealed no memetic corruption in Exhibit G, and thus Exhibit G is here included in its uncensored original form.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-8"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-8')">8</a>. In the interest of fairness, it should be noted that due to RAISA quarantine protocols, neither Dr. Park nor former Site Director Wakefield had access to the testing request labeled Exhibit H at the time of this exchange.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-9"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-9')">9</a>. There is no record of former Site Director Wakefield ever making such a call, nor any evidence that he ever learned that the supposed CALPEI conference did not exist.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-10"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-10')">10</a>. As a result of this interview, Mr. Mhlanga is no longer classified as a Person of Interest, and Foundation surveillance of his activities has been cancelled.</div>
</div>
